<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50643" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vertē^bra</span></b> , ae, f.
		verto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a joint.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i><span class="en">Cels. 8,
			1</span></i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 46, 106, § 255</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 78, 8</span></i>.—Of insects,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				11, 1, 1, § 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., <i>a
			joint</i>, <i>vertebra</i> of the spine, <i><span class="en">Cels. 8,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			In late Lat. collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vertē^brum</span></b> , i, n., =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχίον</span>, <i>the
				hip-bone</i>, Cael. Aur Acut. 1, 10, 71 al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
